 THIS IS A PLACEHOLDER — DELETE THIS FILE.
========================================================================
You must download your OWN google-services.json from the Firebase console
and place the REAL file here, at:  app/google-services.json

How to get it:
1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com and create a project.
2. Add an Android app. Use this EXACT package name:
       com.example.signinsignout
3. Download the generated google-services.json.
4. Put it in the app/ folder (same folder this placeholder is in).
5. Delete this placeholder file.

The app will NOT build/run against Firebase until the real file is in place.
